## Nx Komutları

```bash
# Tüm projeleri build et
pnpm nx run-many -t build

# Sadece değişen projeleri build et
pnpm nx affected -t build

# Tek proje build
pnpm nx run web:build
pnpm nx run api:build

# Test
pnpm nx run-many -t test
pnpm nx run api:test --watch

# Lint
pnpm nx run-many -t lint

# Dependency graph görselleştir
pnpm nx graph

# Yeni kütüphane oluştur
pnpm nx g @nx/js:library shared-types --directory=packages/shared-types
```

## CI/CD Pipeline

### PR Açıldığında (ci.yml)
1. `pnpm install`
2. `nx affected -t lint` — sadece değişen projeleri lint et
3. `nx affected -t test` — sadece değişen projeleri test et
4. `nx affected -t build` — sadece değişen projeleri build et
5. Build başarılıysa → PR merge edilebilir

### Develop Branch'e Merge (deploy-dev.yml)
1. `prisma migrate deploy` → Dev DB migration (Neon develop branch)
2. `nx run api:build` → Docker image → dev-api.turta.com deploy
3. Mobil + Web ekip hemen kullanabilir

### Staging Branch'e Merge (deploy-staging.yml)
1. `prisma migrate deploy` → Staging DB migration
2. `prisma db seed` → Test verisi yenile
3. `nx run web:build` → staging.turta.com deploy
4. `nx run api:build` → staging-api.turta.com deploy
5. QA süreci başlar

### Main Branch'e Merge (deploy-prod.yml)
1. `nx run web:build` → Vercel'e deploy (turta.com)
2. `nx run api:build` → Docker image → Railway'e push (api.turta.com)
3. `prisma migrate deploy` → Production DB migration

### Scheduled: Dev DB Reset (weekly-reset.yml — Pazar 03:00)
1. `neonctl branches reset develop --parent main` → Temiz veri
2. `prisma migrate deploy` → Migration'lar tekrar
3. `prisma db seed` → Seed veri yeniden oluştur

## Ortam Değişkenleri Yönetimi

| Ortam | Web (.env) | API (.env) | DB |
|-------|-----------|-----------|-----|
| Local | `apps/web/.env.local` | `apps/api/.env` | Docker localhost:5433 |
| Dev (paylaşılan) | - | Railway env vars | Neon `develop` branch |
| Staging | Vercel env vars | Railway env vars | Neon `staging` branch |
| Production | Vercel env vars | Railway env vars | Neon `main` branch |

### Zorunlu Env Değişkenleri (API)
```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://tourtech:tourtech@localhost:5433/tourtech?schema=public
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
JWT_SECRET=<random-secret>
MINIO_ENDPOINT=localhost
MINIO_PORT=9000
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=tourtech
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=tourtech123
RESEND_API_KEY=<optional>
```

### Zorunlu Env Değişkenleri (Web)
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3001
```

Auth: Nest JWT Bearer (memory). next-auth / Keycloak env **yok**.

## Branch Stratejisi

```
main (production)
├── staging (pre-production test)
└── develop (aktif geliştirme)
    ├── feat/tour-search
    ├── feat/payment-integration
    ├── fix/booking-validation
    └── refactor/catalog-module
```

- `develop` → `staging`: Her sprint sonunda
- `staging` → `main`: QA onayı sonrası
- Feature branch → `develop`: PR + code review + CI geçmeli
